<p>Your curse feeds on the magic, which in turn is powered by the curse.</p><p>You gain a bonus to Spellpower equal to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 25%, 30%, 35%, 40%</acronym> of your Willpower.</p><p>You gain a bonus to Mindpower equal to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">25%, 32%, 38%, 44%, 50%</acronym> of your Magic.</p><p></p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Something is not quite right inside you.  Your solar spells are somehow twisted, but your bloody rites make things clear as day.</span></span></p>